Privacy Policy
Last updated: October 31, 2026

This Privacy Policy describes how we ("the Developer", "we", "us", or "our") collect, use, and disclose your information when you use our mobile application (the "Application").

By using the Application, you agree to the collection and use of information in accordance with this Privacy Policy.

1. Information Collection and Use
