The Application does not require users to create an account or provide personally identifiable information (such as your real name, email address, physical address, or phone number) to function.

b. Usage and Technical Data
To ensure stable performance, improve application features, and analyze user interaction, the Application may automatically collect certain non-personal technical data, including:

Device model and hardware characteristics

Operating system version

Unique device identifiers (e.g., Advertising ID)

In-app events, performance metrics, and crash logs

2. Third-Party Services
The Application may utilize third-party services that collect information used to identify your device. These third-party service providers have their own privacy policies governing data usage:

Google Play Services (Core functionality and distribution)

Google Analytics / Firebase (App performance and crash reporting)

