3. Data Storage and Retention
Local Storage: Progress, preferences, and gameplay/app data are saved locally on your device. Uninstalling the Application will result in the permanent deletion of locally stored data.

Analytics Data: Non-personal technical logs collected by third-party services are retained in accordance with their respective privacy policies.

4. Children’s Privacy
The Application is not intended for use by children under the age of 13 (or under 16 depending on applicable legal jurisdiction). We do not knowingly collect personally identifiable information from children. If you are a parent or legal guardian and discover that your child has provided personal information, please contact us so that appropriate steps can be taken to remove the data.

5. Security
We value your trust in providing non-personal technical information and strive to use commercially acceptable means of protecting it. However, no method of transmission over the internet or method of electronic storage is 100% secure, and absolute security cannot be guaranteed.

6. Changes to This Privacy Policy
We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be published on this page with an updated "Last updated" date. You are advised to review this Privacy Policy periodically for any changes.
